			"local_notes": "Lore: See the Ork Boy template.\n\nDesign: DX+2 (13) for 4 points, Easy. Raised after combat-simulator testing (user direction); Orks outfight Guardsmen in the lore, hitting on 3+ where the Guard hit on 4+, and the old DX+0 choppa lost every close fight to a retreating Guardsman.",
